# Maximum Overdrive: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. It gains deathtouch and indestructible until end of turn."
# Bot2 Bolts Bot1's Walking Corpse (2/2) on turn 2; Bot1 answers with Maximum Overdrive, paid exactly from two Moxen. The
# counter makes it 3/3 (CR 122.1a), so the Bolt's 3 damage is lethal damage (CR 704.5g) but indestructible keeps it on the
# battlefield (CR 702.12b). On turn 3 the keywords are gone (CR 514.2, "until end of turn") and the counter stays, so it is
# a 3/3 with no damage; Bot2's second Bolt on turn 4 then destroys it.

